# Test conventions

- Use `@QuarkusTest` + RestAssured for HTTP APIs.
- Mock or stub YouTube API in tests — do not call live YouTube from CI.
- Use test `%test` profile properties for `youtube.api.key` if needed.
- Self-contained tests; clean DB state per test when mutating.

No test suite exists yet — add tests following this rule when implementing coverage.
